      <h1 id="creating-machineset-azure-stack-hub" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating a compute machine set on Azure Stack Hub<a href="#creating-machineset-azure-stack-hub" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>You can create a different compute machine set to serve a specific purpose in your OpenShift Container Platform cluster on Microsoft Azure Stack Hub. For example, you might create infrastructure machine sets and related machines so that you can move supporting workloads to the new machines.</p>
